{
  "id": 8859736342727,
  "title": "Personalized Colorful Yggdrasil Tree of Life Quilt Sets - Yggdrasil",
  "handle": "personalized-colorful-yggdrasil-tree-of-life-quilt-sets-yggdrasil",
  "body_html": "<p>Welcome timeless elegance and comfort into your home with the Jeminise Tree of Life Quilt Set. This beautiful bedding set features the symbolic Yggdrasil design, bringing resilience and interconnectedness to your sanctuary. It's an ideal choice for adding a touch of meaningful artistry and cozy warmth to any bedroom.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Meaningful Design:</strong> Showcases the amazing Yggdrasil Tree of Life, symbolizing resilience, strength, and interconnectedness.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in Throw (60x70 inches), Twin (68x86 inches), Full (80x90 inches), Queen (90x90 inches), and King (91x102 inches) to perfectly fit your bed.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Functional as a bedding set or a cozy wrap for relaxing on the sofa, suitable for indoor and outdoor use in all seasons.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Thoughtful Gift:</strong> A perfect and practical present for housewarmings, weddings, Valentine's Day, Mother's Day, Father's Day, Christmas, or for beloved family members like moms, dads, sisters, brothers, and more.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water and air dry without heat, ensuring the microfiber remains fluffy and easy to maintain.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> This set includes 1 Quilt, with an optional Pillowcase available.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Product Style:</strong> Features a minimalist style with specially designed colorful themes on smooth material.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Sets</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Tree of Life</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Tree of Life</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Colorful Tree of Life</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Minimalist</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polycotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Cotton, Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Throw(60x70 inches), Twin(68x86 inches), Full(80x90 inches), Queen (90x90 inches), King (91x102 inches)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>1 Quilt + Pillowcase (Optional)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
